1
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,020
Oh, dude!

2
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,997
Now I'm all covered in soup!

3
00:00:05,080 --> 00:00:07,057
Well, it ain't fit for eating, is it?

4
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,300
Why not wear it?

5
00:00:09,640 --> 00:00:10,470
Hehehehe!

6
00:00:10,553 --> 00:00:12,200
Bring out another barrelful!

7
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,140
We'll have a food fight!

8
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,960
Pour some over here!

9
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:24,580
There's plenty of food here!

10
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:27,657
No reason for anyone in Wano to go hungry!

11
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,600
So why do you idiots have all of it?

12
00:01:11,640 --> 00:01:12,957
Thank

13
00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:14,357
you

14
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:21,440
so

15
00:01:27,280 --> 00:01:28,110
much for watching.

16
00:01:53,620 --> 00:01:55,860
Dream it out

17
00:01:57,060 --> 00:01:57,890
Woah!

18
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:03,090
Woah!

19
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:06,930
Woah!

20
00:02:16,700 --> 00:02:18,420
This guy is a freak!

21
00:02:18,780 --> 00:02:20,540
He's really into that soup.

22
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:21,720
Kinda weird.

23
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:29,760
Yeah, it's damn good.

24
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:33,100
Nothing in the whole world
tastes as sweet as this.

25
00:02:40,580 --> 00:02:42,440
You don't even want this!

26
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:45,840
Why do you get to have it
while Dome goes hungry?

27
00:02:58,420 --> 00:02:59,820
Ah!

28
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:01,470
Woo!

29
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:07,080
The Rockstar!

30
00:03:08,100 --> 00:03:10,400
The Rockstar!

31
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:12,730
The Rockstar!

32
00:03:12,813 --> 00:03:13,643
Ah!

33
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:18,340
Ah!

34
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:20,900
Ah!

35
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,820
Hey, Captain, look.

36
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,560
Damn Straw Hats!

37
00:03:44,760 --> 00:03:47,172
The moron can't even follow his own plan!

38
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:49,437
I thought we were avoiding fights.

39
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:52,814
Isn't that the whole reason
why we're wearing disguises?

40
00:03:53,060 --> 00:03:53,890
Whatever.

41
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:56,840
Kid, let him be.

42
00:03:57,240 --> 00:04:01,980
If the idiot wants to make a scene, that
makes it easier for us to pass through.

43
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,600
What the hell?

44
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:45,440
You couldn't resist, huh?

45
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:48,060
You really made a mess down here.

46
00:04:50,340 --> 00:04:55,000
I follow the chaos, and what do
you know, it leads straight to you.

47
00:04:55,980 --> 00:04:57,520
What the hell, Luffy?

48
00:04:58,400 --> 00:05:00,020
You're gonna get us killed.

49
00:05:00,280 --> 00:05:02,880
You can't do anything quietly, can you?

50
00:05:03,460 --> 00:05:04,290
Unreal.

51
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:07,400
Is this how it goes every
time with those fools?

52
00:05:11,120 --> 00:05:12,840
Do you know what they did?

53
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:17,120
See that soup?

54
00:05:17,340 --> 00:05:19,164
They wasted it all for a laugh.

55
00:05:19,520 --> 00:05:20,960
Red bean soup.

56
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:24,260
I had no idea that food
could taste so good!

57
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:30,080
If that's the case, I'll
have to cut them to shreds.

58
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,580
What do we got going on here?

59
00:05:41,840 --> 00:05:43,480
All that for soup?

60
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:45,740
Any idea why they got so angry?

61
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,680
That crew is hopeless.

62
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,713
I can't work with them.

63
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:52,040
Well, crap.

64
00:05:52,220 --> 00:05:54,102
Think they're gonna notice this.

65
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:58,797
We got all those guys riled up way before
the final battle's supposed to start.

66
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:02,600
Maybe that's true, but it's not
like they know who we are yet.

67
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:06,200
Well, you satisfied now? Yep.

68
00:06:07,020 --> 00:06:08,480
And so am I.

69
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,757
Let's get out of here!

70
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,670
Yeah!

71
00:06:10,820 --> 00:06:12,140
They're running away!

72
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:16,080
After them!

73
00:06:17,260 --> 00:06:18,760
What's all that noise?

74
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:21,315
Don't tell me someone started a fight.

75
00:06:22,960 --> 00:06:23,790
Hmm.

76
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,500
Wait a second.

77
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,030
Uh-oh.

78
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:37,820
Up-a-boo, chicken!

79
00:06:39,100 --> 00:06:40,200
You queen!

80
00:06:40,540 --> 00:06:43,037
Stop screwing around, we
got something going down!

81
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:44,740
Do you feel myself? Yo,

82
00:06:44,980 --> 00:06:49,057
yo, yo, I poop, I poop, tell me what
I gotta do, what are we going through,

83
00:06:49,140 --> 00:06:53,493
something's really buggin' you, lay
it on the street, now that's your cue.

84
00:06:53,780 --> 00:06:54,740
That voice.

85
00:06:57,060 --> 00:07:02,280
Check it out, with Udon under your
supervision, no one escapes your prison.

86
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:07,300
The rats were locked up
tight, no hope in sight.

87
00:07:09,660 --> 00:07:12,280
Check out that brat wearing the Straw Hat.

88
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:17,460
Huh? Wanna fight?

89
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:22,817
There's no forgetting that face,
you must have wrecked the place!

90
00:07:22,900 --> 00:07:25,488
Turned your labor camp
into a damn disgrace!

91
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,520
The hell!

92
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:50,340
Face the facts!

93
00:07:50,460 --> 00:07:51,695
They made a comeback!

94
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:58,380
Straw Hat Loopy kicking alive!

95
00:07:58,660 --> 00:08:01,140
Pirate Hunter Zoro in overdrive!

96
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:06,060
So he broke out of prison after all.

97
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:07,877
This is the Chief Warden.

98
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:09,920
It seems we finally got through.

99
00:08:10,260 --> 00:08:13,025
I just called to let you
know that all is well.

100
00:08:18,340 --> 00:08:20,797
Before you party, do me a favor,

101
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:24,677
catch those suckers—make it quick
before they pull a dirty trick!

102
00:08:24,760 --> 00:08:31,277
I see, I see, but if I make them
history, what the hell's that do for me?

103
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:35,477
Now that you mention it—there's
someone I'm about to get rid of:

104
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:39,097
uh, a toby robo!

105
00:08:39,180 --> 00:08:40,240
They're gonna

106
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:09,137
have a bacon slot in their lineup.

107
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:12,900
their lineup, So, whoever catches
those rats gets a promotion!

108
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:22,100
The Toby Rope, huh?

109
00:09:22,340 --> 00:09:25,458
If that doesn't motivate
you, I don't know what will!

110
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:30,040
This one is mine!

111
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:40,220
That must be Kaido's tower.

112
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,311
Don't get stuck fighting.

113
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,457
We need to push through.

114
00:09:43,540 --> 00:09:44,370
Got it.

115
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:01,837
These guys are a little
tougher, aren't they?

116
00:10:01,920 --> 00:10:04,040
They're slowing us down. Uh-huh.

117
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:06,849
I think they've all
got smile fruit powers.

118
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:28,520
You're gonna feel my
fightin' music, Scratch!

119
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:29,930
Ah!

120
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,740
Luffy! What the?

121
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:41,060
Someone punched me?

122
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:47,300
Wait, I know that guy.

123
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:49,619
I think he used to be Jaggy's ally.

124
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:52,950
Slash!

125
00:10:54,620 --> 00:10:55,450
No!

126
00:10:55,533 --> 00:10:56,620
He cut me?

127
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:04,113
But he doesn't have a blade, and I
couldn't see his line of attack at all.

128
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:07,480
How the hell does his power work?

129
00:11:11,060 --> 00:11:12,720
Oh, God. Whoa!

130
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:17,850
Luffy!

131
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:24,660
Goddamn, you busted their asses.

132
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:25,700
That was easy.

133
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:33,480
This is bad.

134
00:11:33,980 --> 00:11:35,039
We gotta get away.

135
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:37,077
Don't just stand there, you goons.

136
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:38,197
You got them on the ropes.

137
00:11:38,280 --> 00:11:39,957
Now hurry and finish the job.

138
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:43,220
You want to be a part
of the Dome Robo or not?

139
00:11:43,660 --> 00:11:45,200
Get to work!

140
00:11:46,360 --> 00:11:48,260
We can't take a beating here.

141
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,520
Not like this.

142
00:11:53,860 --> 00:11:56,380
We need every ounce of strength for Kaido.

143
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,237
They've got us outnumbered.

144
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,438
But that's not all.

145
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:01,720
They're strong too.

146
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,320
I've got you now!

147
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:10,920
I'm good now.

148
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,513
Sorry about that, Zoro.

149
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,300
You better be.

150
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:17,537
There's no point in wearing
these anymore, right?

151
00:12:17,620 --> 00:12:18,820
I guess not.

152
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:21,940
They're too constricting
anyway. Alright then.

153
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:26,240
No holding back!

154
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:28,286
We gotta break through quick!

155
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,560
You got it!

156
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:32,500
You think it's that easy?

157
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:36,780
As long as you're in my range,
I can mess you up! Check it out!

158
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,320
So how do we fight that?

159
00:12:40,280 --> 00:12:41,110
Scratch!

160
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:46,160
Kid, stop!

161
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:47,893
You'll blow your cover!

162
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:02,780
Let them know I'm here!

163
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:12,220
You're going to pay, filthy train.

164
00:13:14,140 --> 00:13:18,020
So much suffering and I owe it all to you.

165
00:13:22,820 --> 00:13:25,660
I'll see you in hell and go!

166
00:13:26,300 --> 00:13:27,260
Hell no!

167
00:13:34,400 --> 00:13:36,680
Get back!

168
00:13:52,780 --> 00:13:54,000
It's Jaggy!

169
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:55,200
That idiot!

170
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:03,080
Hey, wait a second, who is that guy?

171
00:14:19,780 --> 00:14:22,780
Oh, hell no! Seriously?

172
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:30,460
What the shit is Captain Can't do in here?

173
00:14:34,620 --> 00:14:37,540
Like Straw Hat wasn't bad enough already.

174
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:40,460
What happened in Udon, Babanuki?

175
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:42,797
How did you screw this up so bad?

176
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,586
You're making me look stupid!

177
00:14:56,660 --> 00:15:00,840
You just couldn't wait to form
that alliance with us, could you?

178
00:15:02,700 --> 00:15:04,320
I made a mistake.

179
00:15:04,820 --> 00:15:06,900
I shouldn't have been so trusting.

180
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:14,340
I should have known that you were
working as an informant for Kaido.

181
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:17,840
He was ready for us because
he knew every move we'd make,

182
00:15:17,940 --> 00:15:21,640
and you were the one responsible for that!

183
00:15:25,500 --> 00:15:29,060
You were screwed from the
start, sucker. Oh, yeah?

184
00:15:29,460 --> 00:15:31,617
You thought our alliance was that strong?

185
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:35,117
Strong enough to take on one
of the four emperors that easy?

186
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,800
Get real, you moron!

187
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:42,140
Pirate alliances are
sketchy to begin with.

188
00:15:42,340 --> 00:15:45,634
You're seriously out here
expecting a happy ending, huh?

189
00:15:45,740 --> 00:15:46,600
Well, scratch!

190
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:48,330
Slash!

191
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:05,180
I gotta admit, for such a
chump, you're hard to kill.

192
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:12,000
For all the good it does
you, you're a scumbag. Mr.

193
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:14,649
Queen, we're having a
tough time over here.

194
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:18,117
I don't know if we can
catch these guys alive.

195
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:19,671
They're way too slippery.

196
00:16:20,900 --> 00:16:22,740
Then they'll have to die.

197
00:16:31,260 --> 00:16:32,090
RAPEL!

198
00:16:37,940 --> 00:16:40,440
Seems like you guys have a death wish!

199
00:16:40,740 --> 00:16:43,160
I'd be happy to let you ahead!

200
00:16:47,080 --> 00:16:48,060
There he is!

201
00:16:48,180 --> 00:16:49,415
I knew it was killer!

202
00:17:05,060 --> 00:17:06,140
Come on, kid.

203
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:07,940
We gotta pack it up.

204
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:12,657
Fighting these thugs isn't
going to accomplish anything.

205
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,093
There's no end to them, that's for sure.

206
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:22,920
Hey, stay back!

207
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:26,977
Ah, even if you kill them, they won't
let you be part of the Tobiropo!

208
00:17:27,060 --> 00:17:28,540
Ah-cha-cha!

209
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:33,880
Ah-cha-cha-cha!

210
00:17:41,520 --> 00:17:42,560
Whoa, stop!

211
00:17:42,860 --> 00:17:43,740
You'll hit us!

212
00:17:48,580 --> 00:17:50,600
Ah-cha-cha!

213
00:17:53,060 --> 00:17:55,620
Get away from it! Shut up!

214
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:58,120
Somebody stop him!

215
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:04,140
No way I'm sticking around
for this mess. So long! Peace!

216
00:18:04,660 --> 00:18:06,780
Is that guy part of Kaido's crew?

217
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:08,577
He's going completely nuts!

218
00:18:08,660 --> 00:18:09,760
He's huge!

219
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:11,660
Look at that giant even!

220
00:18:29,940 --> 00:18:31,820
Keep smashing archer.

221
00:18:41,680 --> 00:18:45,580
Sure would be a shame if
someone shot you in the back?

222
00:18:57,980 --> 00:18:58,820
Let's go!

223
00:18:59,160 --> 00:19:00,860
Make a dash for the castle!

224
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:12,140
Ugh, dumb Jaggy!

225
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:15,157
I knew you'd cause a scene
as soon as you ran off!

226
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,160
Grow up!

227
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,857
I don't think you have any
room to talk, honestly.

228
00:19:18,940 --> 00:19:19,770
Yeah?

229
00:19:19,853 --> 00:19:21,780
And the save goes for you, Roan-Noah!

230
00:19:22,780 --> 00:19:24,251
Those three are hopeless.

231
00:19:26,540 --> 00:19:28,000
Running from the fight?

232
00:19:28,160 --> 00:19:30,880
Not a chance when I got you in my side!

233
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:33,472
My fighting music's gonna knock you flat!

234
00:19:33,660 --> 00:19:34,880
One more round!

235
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:37,360
I'll break it down, check it out!

236
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:39,920
Hey, cover your ears!

237
00:19:40,620 --> 00:19:42,640
Oh, man!

238
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:52,530
Agh!

239
00:20:08,420 --> 00:20:10,037
I think I've figured it out.

240
00:20:10,120 --> 00:20:13,600
I prove his attacks are only
effective within earshot.

241
00:20:13,780 --> 00:20:16,486
But once you hear him,
it's too late to dodge.

242
00:20:17,060 --> 00:20:18,840
He's fast, so be ready.

243
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,760
Huh? What? Huh?

244
00:20:22,060 --> 00:20:25,740
Well, it's really important,
so listen close. No problem.

245
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:28,500
Ma-ma-ma-ma.

246
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:33,197
I just got word from my dear children.

247
00:20:33,280 --> 00:20:37,760
They said their ship is still in
working order, so they'll be here soon.

248
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:39,250
But wait.

249
00:20:39,333 --> 00:20:42,277
If they're that close, we
should have heard something.

250
00:20:42,360 --> 00:20:46,184
They have to pass through Mogura
Port to enter the island safely.

251
00:20:49,440 --> 00:20:50,677
At the port?

252
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:51,860
There's a port.

253
00:20:52,900 --> 00:20:53,730
What?

254
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:57,197
The eastern forces led
by Kin'emon are heading

255
00:20:57,280 --> 00:20:59,357
towards the back entrance of the castle.

256
00:20:59,440 --> 00:21:01,717
Everything is proceeding
according to plan.

257
00:21:01,800 --> 00:21:02,630
Listen well.

258
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:05,237
I believe we should
modify our plan somewhat.

259
00:21:05,320 --> 00:21:07,555
Not only have we made steady progress,

260
00:21:07,760 --> 00:21:11,231
but it seems that the enemy
has yet to notice our presence.

261
00:21:11,460 --> 00:21:14,500
Therefore, we should
split in two yet again.

262
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:17,917
The first group will
sneak in from the side of

263
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:20,497
the Skull Dome and wait
inside for the time being.

264
00:21:20,580 --> 00:21:24,117
Thanks to our disguises, you should
be able to blend in quite easily.

265
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:27,737
Meanwhile, the second group will sneak
in from the back entrance of the castle.

266
00:21:27,820 --> 00:21:31,291
Once we're both in position,
we can launch a pincer attack.

267
00:21:31,420 --> 00:21:33,126
There's a lot riding on this.

268
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:36,076
I wonder if Momo's there with Orochi.

269
00:21:39,080 --> 00:21:43,900
Thus, after a few alterations, the
climb continues to progress smoothly.

270
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:50,120
One moment.

271
00:21:51,300 --> 00:21:54,780
Suddenly, they encounter
an unexpected complication.

272
00:21:55,840 --> 00:21:56,670
What a pity.

273
00:21:56,900 --> 00:21:59,677
The information on the
blueprints was out of date.

274
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,120
The base has expanded.

275
00:22:01,440 --> 00:22:02,500
This part is new.

276
00:22:03,120 --> 00:22:07,960
But if 2,000 soldiers try to cross that
bridge, we'll draw far too much attention.

277
00:22:11,860 --> 00:22:13,820
Hey, Keen Emon, huh?

278
00:22:15,360 --> 00:22:17,500
Look, look, look!

279
00:22:18,340 --> 00:22:20,780
It's a pleasure hall just for me!

280
00:22:22,540 --> 00:22:28,180
It was indeed a pleasure hall, owned
by Black Maria, one of the Toby Roper.

281
00:22:32,440 --> 00:22:35,580
My lovely lady sister is going crazy!

282
00:22:37,260 --> 00:22:38,300
No! Sanji!

283
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:40,420
Sanji, please!

284
00:22:43,340 --> 00:22:44,170
Sanji!

285
00:22:44,253 --> 00:22:45,520
Sanji, what are we gonna do?

286
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:48,657
Let me take a small
group and sneak in alone.

287
00:22:48,740 --> 00:22:52,217
We'll rescue Lord Momonosuke while
you take care of the rest, alright?

288
00:22:52,300 --> 00:22:55,577
You haven't said it, but you're
really worried about him, aren't you?

289
00:22:55,660 --> 00:22:56,620
That's fine.

290
00:23:02,980 --> 00:23:06,392
We care about Momo too, I
promise we'll get him back safe.

291
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:11,520
Don't worry, you and Chia just
focus on beating Kaido, okay?

292
00:23:12,740 --> 00:23:15,540
Madame Nami, Madame Carrot, Shinobu!

293
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:20,237
I'm grateful.

294
00:23:20,320 --> 00:23:23,077
Honestly, the matter's
been weighing heavy on me.

295
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,280
Stay safe.

296
00:23:28,460 --> 00:23:30,813
Someone's come out of the Pleasure Hall.

297
00:23:32,820 --> 00:23:33,780
Sir Sanji.

298
00:23:37,280 --> 00:23:39,720
I'm guessing he couldn't find any ladies.

299
00:23:41,620 --> 00:23:44,977
After hearing the commotion
that Reef and the others caused,

300
00:23:45,060 --> 00:23:47,037
almost all of Kardo's subordinates were

301
00:23:47,120 --> 00:23:49,944
rushing out of the Pleasure
Hall to investigate.

302
00:23:53,020 --> 00:23:54,780
Invaders! Capture them!

303
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:56,631
Kill them if you have to!

304
00:24:10,060 --> 00:24:11,140
It's killer!

305
00:24:14,840 --> 00:24:16,720
Hey, hey, hey!

306
00:24:17,620 --> 00:24:19,740
Step up, step up, chumps!

307
00:24:19,860 --> 00:24:21,448
This guy's not that strong!

308
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:23,277
What is taking so long?

309
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:24,820
Ha-pa-pa-pa!

310
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:27,000
Don't you know the story?

311
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:31,300
Killer ate a defective smile
fruit and became a pleasure!

312
00:24:31,740 --> 00:24:34,440
He ain't got no power!

313
00:24:34,900 --> 00:24:35,880
Ha-pa-pa!

314
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:37,840
Let's make a deal!

315
00:24:38,380 --> 00:24:42,733
If you eat this little fruit, I'll
give you a chance to save your captain!

316
00:24:49,380 --> 00:24:51,180
What's so funny?!

317
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:55,360
Don't you dare laugh!

318
00:25:02,340 --> 00:25:06,780
If any bastard laughs at you, I'll
send them straight to hell, understand?

319
00:25:07,320 --> 00:25:08,360
All right.

320
00:25:11,580 --> 00:25:13,100
Jackie, come on!

321
00:25:13,600 --> 00:25:15,860
Stop beating up, dudes, and move it!

322
00:25:19,860 --> 00:25:20,690
Interesting.

323
00:25:20,773 --> 00:25:22,873
So they broke out of the prison in Udon.

324
00:25:23,360 --> 00:25:27,800
Should we catch them won't
be rewarded not worth it.

325
00:25:27,900 --> 00:25:29,640
They're just a couple of rats

326
00:25:30,260 --> 00:25:32,960
Put your efforts into
finding Yamato instead.

327
00:25:33,980 --> 00:25:39,277
That's Kaido's biggest concern right
now, and don't let Sasaki find him first!

328
00:25:39,360 --> 00:25:40,520
Yes, sir.

329
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:48,837
All right time to clean up what's
taking so long knock them other asses.

330
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:50,508
They ain't even that strong

331
00:25:52,080 --> 00:25:52,980
Damn it.

332
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:56,548
Queen, what the hell
are you trying to pull?

333
00:25:59,860 --> 00:26:01,780
You want someone dead, huh?

334
00:26:04,280 --> 00:26:06,220
Well, turns out I do, too.

335
00:26:08,320 --> 00:26:09,150
All right.

336
00:26:09,233 --> 00:26:12,057
No women in the pleasure
hall means no men either.

337
00:26:12,140 --> 00:26:14,199
It is now safe to cross the bridge.

338
00:26:16,000 --> 00:26:18,765
Infiltration team, I wish
you the best of luck.

339
00:26:20,920 --> 00:26:21,750
Nice!

340
00:26:21,833 --> 00:26:23,320
That's the spirit, guys.

341
00:26:23,780 --> 00:26:26,480
My group, follow me! Yes, sir!

342
00:26:29,600 --> 00:26:32,020
Sniper Usopp, AKA Driver Usopp,

343
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:34,537
this is tank commander issuing
orders to proceed slowly.

344
00:26:34,620 --> 00:26:35,920
with Brachio Tank 5.

345
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:38,080
We'll max speed with the infantry.

346
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:41,077
10-4, tank commander chopper good, buddy.

347
00:26:41,160 --> 00:26:44,740
Proceeding forward with maximum slowness.

348
00:26:48,080 --> 00:26:50,037
Keep an eye on the windows of the pleasure

349
00:26:50,120 --> 00:26:52,577
hall there may be a few
people lingering inside.

350
00:26:52,660 --> 00:26:54,020
I'll be vigilant.

351
00:26:56,100 --> 00:26:58,880
If you spy a shadow, that's bad news.

352
00:27:00,540 --> 00:27:04,437
It's awfully noisy out there—move quickly!

353
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:05,837
Dive into the water.

354
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:06,750
water

355
00:27:32,920 --> 00:27:34,360
Come on!

356
00:27:43,820 --> 00:27:45,840
Come on, we're almost there!

357
00:27:47,940 --> 00:27:49,060
You bastard.

358
00:27:49,540 --> 00:27:51,820
I'll make you suffer for that king.

359
00:27:53,140 --> 00:27:55,380
Almost there. Yes! Keep climbing!

360
00:27:55,740 --> 00:27:57,877
Why is this the only way to the island?

361
00:27:57,960 --> 00:27:59,757
Not terribly convenient, is it?

362
00:27:59,840 --> 00:28:01,700
As ridiculous as this is,

363
00:28:01,840 --> 00:28:05,664
it's still not as crazy as the
Alliance we're getting roped into.

364
00:28:05,860 --> 00:28:07,940
Oh, it's lickety-loony for sure.

365
00:28:08,380 --> 00:28:10,257
They don't care what Mama's thinking.

366
00:28:10,340 --> 00:28:12,399
She made the call, so deal with it.

367
00:28:12,700 --> 00:28:14,524
Forget about the damn Alliance.

368
00:28:14,680 --> 00:28:17,562
That is not the reason we
came to Wano, remember?

369
00:28:17,840 --> 00:28:18,670
He's right.

370
00:28:18,900 --> 00:28:20,457
Straw Hat made a fool of Mama,

371
00:28:20,540 --> 00:28:23,217
and we can't rest till we've
restored our family's honor.

372
00:28:23,300 --> 00:28:26,535
We'll serve up that bastard's
head on a silver platter.

373
00:28:26,700 --> 00:28:28,700
That's so savage, don't you think?

374
00:28:29,060 --> 00:28:31,097
Well, I've got a better plan.

375
00:28:31,180 --> 00:28:34,340
I'm gonna make Kinda
Love Me a stamp for me!

376
00:28:35,420 --> 00:28:37,220
Shut the hell up, Flampe!

377
00:28:37,560 --> 00:28:39,360
We've arrived at last!

378
00:28:39,560 --> 00:28:40,797
The land of water!

379
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:43,517
We don't know what's
waiting for us out there.

380
00:28:43,600 --> 00:28:44,600
Weapons ready!

381
00:28:46,460 --> 00:28:47,960
They weren't dead.

382
00:28:48,300 --> 00:28:49,771
They are quite audacious.

383
00:28:50,220 --> 00:28:52,160
Who knows what King might do?

384
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:55,137
He came back!

385
00:28:55,220 --> 00:28:56,140
You're right!

386
00:28:56,620 --> 00:28:57,700
That's scoundrel!

387
00:28:57,920 --> 00:28:59,820
And at the exact same spot, too!

388
00:29:00,680 --> 00:29:02,280
No! Wait!

389
00:29:04,420 --> 00:29:05,340
That's Marco!

390
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:06,910
Huh.

391
00:29:07,040 --> 00:29:09,037
I doubt they're here for sightseeing,

392
00:29:09,120 --> 00:29:12,296
so it looks like the Alliance
thing is true after all.

393
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:14,047
Can't have that, now can we?

394
00:29:25,220 --> 00:29:26,280
All right.

395
00:29:28,100 --> 00:29:29,820
Back down you go.

396
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:31,740
Phoenix!

397
00:29:32,420 --> 00:29:33,250
Brand!

398
00:29:33,780 --> 00:29:35,680
Not today, you foolish bird!

399
00:29:41,460 --> 00:29:43,400
Are you kidding me?

400
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:44,820
Oh, no!

401
00:29:49,540 --> 00:29:52,260
Looks like our fruit's falling down again!

402
00:29:53,340 --> 00:29:56,811
Wano may be a different place
by the time you make it back.

403
00:29:56,900 --> 00:30:00,135
Things have been moving and
shaking around here lately.

404
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:05,620
Got ships falling from
the sky today, do we?

405
00:30:06,540 --> 00:30:07,600
Look up there.

406
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:16,560
It's been so long, I haven't
seen you since the war, Marco.
